 "meta": {
  "id": "eace1c913dcd5fb8b54b4948e31d8f28",
  "name": {
   "zh": "2D 跟踪",
   "en": "2D Tracking"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "在画面上点要跟的点、框平面的四个角，再勾要用的跟踪：CoTracker3、TAPNext++ 跟 2D 点（交付 Nuke Tracker），WOFTSAM 跟平面四角（交付 Nuke CornerPin），AllTracker 把你在一帧上画的图贴满整段（交付 EXR）。CoTracker3 与 TAPNext++ 共用一组跟踪点，点一次两个都跟；坐标就是这段画面的像素，与同一画面上的其他 2D 卡天然对齐。",
   "en": "Pick the points to track and the four corners of a plane in the viewport, then tick the trackers: CoTracker3 and TAPNext++ track 2D points (Nuke Tracker), WOFTSAM tracks plane corners (Nuke CornerPin), AllTracker carries what you paint on one frame through the shot (EXR). CoTracker3 and TAPNext++ share one set of tracks, so you pick once for both; coordinates are the plate's pixels, so they line up with the other 2D cards on the same plate."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-10-04T12:00:00",
  "updated": "2026-10-04T12:00:00",
  "deliverable": "workflow",
  "owner": "admin",
  "internal": [
   "alltracker.picks",
   "alltracker.picks_pick"
  ]
 },
